			"notes": "Update to Minecraft 26.1\n\nOne notable feature in this release is the addition of `mandatePossibleSplash` config, which when enabled, will filter out the splash to only those that is possible to be unlocked via the keyword configured.\n\nThis prevents a rather common situations where the chosen splash is impossible to unlock, requiring another restart to try your luck. (Less of an issue when this mod was first designed for 24w14potato, which has some more references to \"poison\")"
